---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy — GetFOSS';
const description =
  'Learn how GetFOSS handles visitor information, uses Google Analytics to understand website traffic, and protects your privacy.';

const lastUpdated = 'November 26, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <main class="legal-page">
    <header class="legal-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-intro">
        Your privacy matters. This policy explains what information GetFOSS
        processes when you visit our website and how that information is used.
      </p>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </header>

    <article class="legal-content">
      <section>
        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          GetFOSS ("we", "us", or "our") is a website dedicated to free and
          open-source software. We respect your privacy and aim to collect
          as little information as reasonably necessary to operate and
          understand the performance of our website.
        </p>
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy describes how information may be processed
          when you visit <a href="https://www.getfoss.org/">getfoss.org</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Information We Process</h2>
        <p>
          GetFOSS does not require registration, does not offer user accounts,
          and does not ask visitors to provide personal information to browse
          the website.
        </p>
        <p>
          Like most websites, our hosting infrastructure may process
          technical information associated with requests, such as IP
          addresses, browser details, device information, and access
          timestamps. This information may be handled by our hosting
          provider as part of delivering and securing the website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Google Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use GetFOSS
          and to measure website traffic. This helps us evaluate which
          content is useful and improve the website.
        </p>
        <p>
          Google Analytics may process information such as pages visited,
          approximate geographic location, browser and device information,
          referral sources, and interactions with the website. Depending
          on the configuration, Google Analytics may also use cookies or
          similar technologies.
        </p>
        <p>
          We use analytics for website statistics and improvement only.
          GetFOSS does not use Google Analytics for advertising, does not
          run advertisements, and does not use advertising networks.
        </p>
        <p>
          Information processed through Google Analytics is also subject
          to Google's privacy policies. You can learn more at
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Google's Privacy Policy
          </a>
          and
          <a href="https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/6004245" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            How Google uses information from sites or apps that use its services
          </a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Cookies and Local Storage</h2>
        <p>
          GetFOSS may use cookies or similar technologies through Google
          Analytics, depending on its configuration.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our website also uses browser Local Storage to remember your
          selected color theme. This preference is stored locally in your
          browser and is not used to identify you.
        </p>
        <p>
          You can manage or delete cookies and Local Storage through
          your browser settings. Disabling certain technologies may affect
          some website functionality.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Advertising</h2>
        <p>
          GetFOSS does not display advertisements, use advertising
          networks, or sell visitor information to advertisers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>6. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          Our website may link to external websites and services, including
          software projects, repositories, and documentation. These
          third-party websites operate independently and have their own
          privacy policies. We are not responsible for their content or
          privacy practices.
        </p>
        <p>
          Google Analytics and our hosting provider may process technical
          information as described in this policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
          Technical information processed by our hosting provider and
          analytics information may be retained according to the
          respective providers' retention policies and configuration.
          We do not maintain a separate database of visitor accounts
          or personal profiles.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>8. Your Privacy Choices</h2>
        <p>
          You can control cookies and Local Storage through your browser
          settings. You can also use Google's available tools and settings
          to manage certain analytics-related data.
        </p>
        <p>
          Depending on your location, you may have additional rights
          regarding personal information under applicable privacy laws.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy when our website, services,
          or applicable legal requirements change. The latest version
          will always be published on this page, with its update date
          shown above.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>10. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how
          information is handled on GetFOSS, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:info@getfoss.org">info@getfoss.org</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 1.25rem 6rem;
  }

  .legal-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .legal-header h1 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }

  .legal-intro {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 1.25rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .updated {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .legal-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.25rem;
  }

  .legal-content section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--text);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--line);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .legal-content a:hover {
    text-decoration-color: var(--text);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .legal-page {
      padding-top: 2.75rem;
      padding-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .legal-header {
      margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
    }

    .legal-content {
      gap: 1.85rem;
    }
  }
</style>
